 · SCÉNARIOS</div><div style=\\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:8px 0 12px\\">Rapport d’audit énergétique</div><div style=\\"font-size:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #d5e1e6;padding-bottom:8px\\">Bilan des consommations par usage</div><div style=\\"display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-end;height:70px;margin:10px 0\\"><div style=\\"flex:1;text-align:center\\"><div style=\\"height:55px;background:#082d4a\\"></div><span style=\\"font-size:7px\\">Chauffage</span></div><div style=\\"flex:1;text-align:center\\"><div style=\\"height:32px;background:#009fcc\\"></div><span style=\\"font-size:7px\\">Froid</span></div><div style=\\"flex:1;text-align:center\\"><div style=\\"height:45px;background:#55c7d9\\"></div><span style=\\"font-size:7px\\">Ventilation</span></div><div style=\\"flex:1;text-align:center\\"><div style=\\"height:22px;background:#a6dce5\\"></div><span style=\\"font-size:7px\\">Éclairage</span></div></div><div style=\\"font-size:10px;font-weight:bold\\">Plan d’actions et scénarios de travaux</div><div style=\\"height:4px;background:#dce6eb;margin:8px 0;width:94%\\"></div><div style=\\"height:4px;background:#dce6eb;margin:8px 0;width:76%\\"></div></div></div><div style=\\"background:#082d4a;padding:20px 24px;min-height:108px;color:white\\"><span style=\\"background:#01cdf3;color:#082d4a;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 7px\\">01</span><h3 style=\\"font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:white;margin:9px 0\\">Audit énergétique</h3><span style=\\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.05em\\">VOIR LE CONTENU DU LIVRABLE +</span></div></summary><div style=\\"padding:24px;color:#082d4a;line-height:1.7\\">État des lieux, consommations par usage, scénarios de travaux chiffrés.</div></details><details style=\\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d5e1e6;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;text-align:left\\"><summary style=\\"cursor:pointer;list-style:none\\"><div style=\\"height:330px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#edf1f3;padding:15px\\"><div style=\\"background:white;color:#102f45;box-shadow:0 12px 28px #082d4a33;padding:20px;width:86%;height:300px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;transform:rotate(2deg)\\"><div style=\\"font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#527184;text-transform:uppercase\\">BÂTIMENT À USAGE DE BUREAUX</div><div style=\\"font-size:19px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:8px 0 12px\\">Diagnostic de performance<br>énergétique – tertiaire</div><div style=\\"font-size:9px;border-top:1px solid #94aab7;padding-top:6px\\">Consommations annuelles · Émissions de gaz à effet de serre</div><div style=\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:9px\\"><div style=\\"flex:1\\"><strong style=\\"font-size:10px\\">Énergie</strong><div style=\\"display:flex;align-items:center;height:12px;margin:2px 0\\"><span style=\\"display:block;width:45%;background:#159b49;color:#10302e;padding:0 4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 8px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%)\\">A</span></div><div style=\\"display:flex;align-items:center;height:12px;margin:2px 0\\"><span style=\\"display:block;width:55%;background:#54b64a;color:#10302e;padding:0 4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 8px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%)\\">B</span></div><div style=\\"display:flex;align-items:center;height:12px;margin:2px 0\\"><span style=\\"display:block;width:65%;background:#acd04b;color:#10302e;padding:0 4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 8px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%)\\">C</span></div><div style=\\"display:flex;align-items:center;height:12px;margin:2px 0\\"><span style=\\"display:block;width:75%;background:#f4dc46;color:white;padding:0 4px;font-size:9px;font-weight:bold;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 8px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%)\\">D</span></div><div style=\\"display:flex;align-items:center;height:12px;margin:2px 0\\